c Affairs,Finance and LegalFinTech,Finance and LegalSystems,Finance and LegalTreasury,COOMarketing-Planning and Growth,Q-CommerceOperations-Inventory,Q-CommercePerformance and Project Management,Q-commerceOperations-Expansion/Facilities,Q-commerceOperations-Performance and Training,Q-commerceQaaS,Q-commerceCommercial-Private Label,Q-commerceRegional NFV,Q-CommerceRegional NFV,Q-CommerceLocal Shops - Regional,Strategy and InnovationStrategy and Innovation,Chief Business OfficeUser Experience,People and CultureTalent and Culture,COOSSC-Core Operations,People and CultureTotal Rewards,ProductProgram Management,COOPartnerships and Business Development,Strategy and InnovationPartnerships,TechSecurity,TechAgile,TechTesting,Q-commerceGeneral Admin-Management,Q-CommerceStrategy, Growth and Special Projects,Q-commerceSupply Chain-Distribution, Logistics and Network,Q-commerceContent,Q-commerceCommercial-Ad Operations,Q-CommerceOperations-Special Project Ops,Q-CommerceCommercial-Media Solutions and Campaigns,Q-CommerceCommercial-Private Label,Q-CommerceCommercial-Supplier/Category Management&apos;),lower([Calculation_5025876480482725890]+[Calculation_5025876484272406533]))&#10;THEN&#10;&quot;SG&amp;A&quot;&#10;ELSE&#10;&quot;Other&quot;&#10;END' />
